      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}\n\nThanks for your thoughtful reply.\n\nThe VRCScaleConstraint in the image.\n\nWhile setting the Weight to 1, there was a glitch on VRChat where the neck-gear object started vibrating violently, this did not happen with UnityConstraint, so I attribute this to the difference in specifications between VRCConstraint and UnityConstraint So I judged this to be a difference between the VRCConstraint and UnityConstraint specifications.\n\nBut I did not know about the VRCHeadChop component!\n\nThanks for the useful information.\n\nI will use it in my future creations!",
